    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Empyrean iotas are fragments of a deity, its thoughts, memories or passing attention, given form and a measure of independence. They may look like floating glyphs, motes of colored light, sacred symbols or stranger shapes, and they serve as messengers of the gods and helpers to those who serve them. Each iota has its own knowledge and personality, though it may know little beyond its creator’s realm and wishes.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
